        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BRK1005RDHSBR, Hammered Brass Brooks Circle Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade from brass, the Brooks Full Circle Door Pull is hand hammered to make the unique and beautiful water-like design. Due to the handmade nature of this pull, no two will be exactly the same. The Brooks Door Handle can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. It measures 5-1/2 inches across. Choose from a huge selection of finishes from modern to traditional.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BRK01-specifcations.gif?v=1704354771\" width=\"449\" height=\"271\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions BRK1005RDHSBR Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions BRK1005RDHSBR Brooks Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Diameter: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .38\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.38\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BRK01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262334\"><b>First Impressions BRK1005RDHSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Brooks Hand Hammered Full Circle Door Pull",
                "description": "Made from brass, the Brooks Full Circle Door Pull is hand hammered to make the unique and beautiful water-like design. Due to the handmade nature of this pull, no two will be exactly the same. The Brooks Door Handle can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. It measures 5-1/2 inches across. Choose from a huge selection of finishes from modern to traditional.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Brooks Full Circle Door Handles, Brooks Hand Hammered Full Circle Door Pulls, First Impressions BRK01, FII-BRK01, 5-1-/2 inch circle door pulls, round door pulls, First Impressions brooks collection series 1 door pulls, Hammered Brass Brooks Circle Pulls, First Impressions BRK01 Brooks Door Handles, FII-BRK1005RDHSBR, First Impressions BRK1005RDHSBR, first impressions brooks 1,"
